;; Card e8eb3a11 (get-kit stopped "no source for iron_ingot: gathering ended :none-seen" with no ore in sight): obtain's mine for an unseen
;; ore strip-tunnels, and a run that cut new rock and saw none is no fruitless run, so the next mines on while another run pays.
;; Stone mass x 3..46, y -1..1, z 3..9, under a bedrock roof (y 2..3), the body 3 west of its face facing east; one iron ore in the tunnel line
;; 40 blocks east, past the first run's 32-block tunnel. child/max-fruitless 1 makes one empty run end the gather unless it mines on; the plot
;; lies below iron's tunnel level and the roof the body sees bars a stair up to it (obtain.plan/climb-sealed?), so the tunnel keeps the body's
;; height; the mass's west face is dirt (no host rock seen, so no look round pays first and walks the body off its east heading) and the
;; walls of the body's own tunnel are no evidence for a look (cost/look-leg-chance), so the run after an empty one mines on. :worth 5000 and :spend :job-time 2700 stand for a goal's
;; (get-kit passes its bill's, and the time of a bill item: a default call has too little time left for a find at this depth). Should-succeed: the second run reaches the ore, no climb. Should-fail: a caller who wants one raw iron little more than it
;; usually costs (:worth 210; the search price is capped at that usual cost, 208 s, so the start check passes by 2 s and the refuse margin is the old measured one, 42 s more than at 250) has, after the first run's cut, no worth left for a strip leg: it counts fruitless, no source; a tunnel line open all the way (card 317311e9) cuts
;; nothing, so its run is fruitless though its tunnel took steps.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:obtain :mine :jobs] :time :any
  :plot {:light :lit :height 10 :length 50 :width 16}
  :blocks [[:fill [3 -1 3] [46 1 9] "stone"] [:fill [3 2 3] [46 3 9] "bedrock"] [:fill [3 -1 3] [3 1 9] "dirt"] [:set [40 0 6] "iron_ore"]]
  :body {:at [0.5 0 6.5] :yaw 270 :inventory [["stone_pickaxe" 2] ["torch" 16] ["cobblestone" 16]] :effects [["resistance" 900 4]]}
  :limit-s 400}
 :cases
 [{:name "unseen-ore-mined-on-past-an-empty-tunnel"
   :act [[:job (jobs.items.obtain {:item "raw_iron" :count 1 :ways #{:craft :smelt :gather} :worth 5000 :spend {:job-time 2700}
                                   :settings {:jobs.lib.child/max-fruitless 1}})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :obtain.strip-on} :within-s 300 :of-job true}
            {:event {:source :job :kind :completed} :within-s 390 :of-job true}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :obtain.climbed} :for-s 390 :until {:source :job :kind :completed}}]
   :after [[:item "raw_iron" [:>= 1]]]}
  {:name "a-run-that-does-not-pay-ends-after-the-empty-tunnel"
   :act [[:job (jobs.items.obtain {:item "raw_iron" :count 1 :ways #{:craft :smelt :gather} :worth 210
                                   :settings {:jobs.lib.child/max-fruitless 1}})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :stopped :data {:reason :no-source}} :within-s 300 :of-job true}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :obtain.strip-on} :for-s 300 :until {:source :job :kind :stopped}}]
   :after [[:item "raw_iron" [:= 0]]]}
  {:name "a-tunnel-through-open-air-is-no-new-ground"
   :blocks [[:fill [3 0 6] [46 1 6] "air"]]
   :act [[:job (jobs.items.obtain {:item "raw_iron" :count 1 :ways #{:craft :smelt :gather} :worth 5000 :spend {:job-time 2700}
                                   :settings {:jobs.lib.child/max-fruitless 1}})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :obtain.gathering :data {:item "raw_iron"}} :within-s 120 :of-job true}
            {:event {:source :job :kind :stopped :data {:reason :no-source}} :within-s 300 :of-job true}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :obtain.strip-on} :for-s 300 :until {:source :job :kind :stopped}}]
   :after [[:item "raw_iron" [:= 0]]]}]}
